<view class="page booking-page"><view class="title">预约口腔就诊</view><view class="subtitle">找到合适的门店、医生和时间。</view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-item active"><text>1</text>门店与需求</view><view class="progress-line"></view><view class="progress-item {{slots.length ? 'active' : ''}}"><text>2</text>医生与时间</view><view class="progress-line"></view><view class="progress-item {{selected > -1 ? 'active' : ''}}"><text>3</text>确认预约</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="loading">正在读取就诊安排…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}<button class="link" bindtap="records">查看我的预约 →</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{!authenticated && !busy}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-symbol">＋</view><view class="empty-title">微信登录后查看可约时间</view><view class="description">登录后选择门店、就诊需求和时间，首次就诊填写本人资料即可预约。</view><button type="primary" bindtap="login">微信登录</button></view>
<block wx:if="{{authenticated}}"><view class="card"><view class="step-label">01 / 选择就诊安排</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">就诊门店</text><picker range="{{clinics}}" range-key="label" value="{{clinicIndex}}" bindchange="clinic" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="picker">{{clinics[clinicIndex].label || '选择门店'}}<text class="picker-arrow">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">这次想看什么？</text><view class="intent-grid"><button wx:for="{{commonVisits}}" wx:key="id" data-intent="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseIntent" disabled="{{busy || unknown || !item.available}}" class="intent-card {{visitIntent === item.id ? 'selected-intent' : ''}}"><view class="intent-title">{{item.label}}</view><view class="intent-description">{{item.available ? item.description : '门店暂未配置该服务'}}</view></button></view><button class="link" data-intent="OTHER" bindtap="chooseIntent" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">其他明确服务 {{visitIntent === 'OTHER' ? '⌃' : '⌄'}}</button><view wx:if="{{visitIntent !== 'OTHER'}}" class="hint">不确定牙齿问题，选择“看牙检查”即可。实际方案由医生到诊后确定。</view><checkbox-group wx:if="{{visitIntent === 'OTHER'}}" class="project-list {{expanded ? '' : 'collapsed'}}" bindchange="treatments"><label wx:for="{{treatments}}" wx:key="id" class="service-label"><checkbox color="#17778b" value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.selected}}" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/><text>{{item.label}}</text></label></checkbox-group><button wx:if="{{visitIntent === 'OTHER' && treatments.length > 3}}" class="link" bindtap="expandServices">{{expanded ? '收起服务项目' : '展开全部服务项目'}} · {{treatments.length}} 项</button><view wx:if="{{!treatments.length}}" class="hint">暂无可选服务，请联系诊所。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">就诊日期 · 北京时间</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="{{today}}" bindchange="date" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="picker">{{date || '选择日期'}}<text class="picker-arrow">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="spacer"></view><button type="primary" bindtap="search" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">查看医生与可约时间</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{searched}}" class="card"><view class="step-label">02 / 选择医生与真实时段</view><view class="result-context">{{resultClinic}} · {{resultDate}}<view>已加载 {{slots.length}} 个可约时段{{next ? ' · 还有更多可加载' : ''}}</view></view><view class="description">仅展示符合本次项目资质、正常排班且可预约的医生。</view><view wx:if="{{!slots.length && !busy}}" class="slot-empty"><view class="card-title">当天暂无可约时段</view><view class="description">换个日期或门店再试试，也可联系诊所安排。</view></view><view wx:if="{{doctors.length}}" class="doctor-list"><view class="doctor-chip {{doctorId === '' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="" bindtap="chooseDoctor">全部医生</view><view wx:for="{{doctors}}" wx:key="id" class="doctor-chip {{doctorId === item.id ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseDoctor"><view class="doctor-name">{{item.name}}<text>{{item.title}}</text></view><view class="doctor-direction">{{item.specialty}}</view><view wx:if="{{doctorId === item.id}}" class="doctor-bio">{{item.introduction}}</view></view></view><view wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-index="slotIndex"><button wx:if="{{!doctorId || doctorId === item.dentist_id}}" class="slot {{selected === slotIndex ? 'chosen-slot' : ''}}" data-index="{{slotIndex}}" bindtap="select" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"><view class="slot-top"><text>{{item.dentist_name}}</text><text class="slot-tag">{{selected === slotIndex ? '已选时段' : '可预约'}}</text></view><view class="slot-time">{{item.time}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.professional_title || '职称暂未提供'}} · 挂号费 ¥{{item.fee}}</view></button></view><button wx:if="{{next}}" class="link" bindtap="more" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}">加载更多真实时段</button></view>
<view id="booking-confirmation" wx:if="{{selected > -1 || unknown}}" class="card"><view wx:if="{{!patient}}"><view class="card-title">填写本人就诊资料</view><view class="description">首次就诊无需患者编号，也无需等待人工核验。保存后返回此页，系统会重新核对并恢复所选时段。</view><view class="spacer"></view><button type="primary" bindtap="binding">填写资料，继续预约</button></view><block wx:else><view class="step-label">03 / 确认就诊安排</view><view class="summary-person"><text class="card-title">{{patient.full_name}}</text><text class="badge">本人档案</text></view><view class="description">{{patient.patient_number}} · {{patient.phone}}</view><view wx:if="{{selected > -1}}" class="notice"><view>{{clinics[clinicIndex].label}}</view><view>{{slots[selected].dentist_name}} · {{slots[selected].time}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{patient.self_reported_allergies}}" class="description">{{patient.self_reported_allergies}}（本人声明，非医护核实）</view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">出生日期</text><text class="detail-value">{{patient.date_of_birth}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text class="detail-label">就诊需求</text><text class="detail-value">{{serviceSummary}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{selected > -1}}" class="fee-summary"><text>挂号费</text><text>¥ {{slots[selected].fee}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{selected > -1 && slots[selected].registration_fee_fen > 0}}" class="hint">演示支付，不扣真实款。号源保留5分钟，缴费后确认预约；取消预约后按规则退费。</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="field-label">过敏信息</view><view class="description">{{patient.allergy_review_status === 'NO_KNOWN' ? '经诊所核实无已知过敏' : patient.allergy_review_status === 'RECORDED' ? '存在已记录过敏，请逐项核对' : '本人填报，待就诊时由医护复核'}}</view><view wx:for="{{allergies}}" wx:key="allergy_id" class="allergy-item">{{item.allergy_name}} · {{item.severity_note || '程度未填写'}}</view><view class="spacer"></view><checkbox-group bindchange="confirm"><label class="check-label"><checkbox color="#17778b" value="confirmed" checked="{{confirmed}}" disabled="{{busy || unknown}}"/><text>确认本人资料、本次就诊安排和过敏信息属实；本人填报信息请在就诊时向医护说明。如资料有变化，请联系门店更正。</text></label></checkbox-group><view class="spacer"></view><button type="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || (unknown ? false : (!confirmed || 0 > selected))}}">{{unknown ? '重新确认办理结果' : (selected > -1 && slots[selected].registration_fee_fen > 0 ? '去演示缴费' : '确认预约')}}</button><button wx:if="{{unknown}}" class="link" bindtap="query" disabled="{{busy}}">查询办理进度</button></block></view></block><view class="footnote">预约以提交时的后台核验为准。时间、资质、排班及占位均由诊所系统实时校验。</view></view>


